VIDEO = {'footer': 'HTTP Basics and Security Headers  ·  Security Basics  ·  Java', 'poster': {'headline': [('HTTP BASICS AND', 'text'), ('SECURITY HEADERS', 'accent')], 'taglines': [("A web request is just text, and every line of it is the sender's choice", 'gold')], 'before': {'code': 'Set-Cookie: session=abc', 'note': 'readable, and sent anywhere', 'tag': 'BEFORE'}, 'after': {'code': 'Secure; HttpOnly; SameSite=Lax', 'note': 'plus five security headers', 'tag': 'AFTER'}}, 'highlight': {'console_green': ['THE REQUEST', 'THE SEARCH TEXT', 'THE COOKIES', 'THE RESPONSES', 'HEADERS SET BADLY', 'MORE MESSAGES', 'AFTER THE FIX'], 'console_rose': ['THE PARSED REQUEST', "THE PARSER'S ANSWER", 'THE VERDICT', 'THE AUDIT', 'BEFORE THE FIX', 'Set-Cookie: session=attacker'], 'console_amber': ['total', 'after the blank line', 'written out again', 'score', 'a header is only worth'], 'console_cyan': ['refused', 'accepted']}}
